The plate is square and about 20-22 cm across, so it is probably a side plate. The apple measures about 125 px across against a plate width of roughly 350 px. That puts the apple at about 7.5 cm in diameter, which is a medium apple of roughly 170 g. At about 52 kcal per 100 g, that comes to roughly 90 kcal.

The small orange smear and fragment on the plate are negligible.

